OL,3,GNEWSADomestic abuser jailed for
OL,4,Amurdering wife in bed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 79-year-old man from West Sussex has
OL,7,Fbeen sentenced to life in prison for
OL,8,Fstabbing his wife of 50 years to death
OL,9,Fin bed.
OL,11,FMichael Pyke murdered Beryl Pyke, 84,
OL,12,Fat their home in Langley Grove,
OL,13,FAldwick, in May this year.
OL,15,FLewes Crown Court heard that Pyke
OL,16,Fphoned his cousin the following day,
OL,17,Fsaying: "I've murdered Beryl...I'm
OL,18,Fgoing to have a bloody good drink."
