OL,3,GNEWSADomestic abuser jailed for
OL,4,Amurdering wife in bed
OL,5,
OL,6,FPyke pleaded guilty to murder on 19
OL,7,FOctober and was sentenced to life with
OL,8,Fa minimum term of 15 years at Hove
OL,9,FCrown Court on Friday.
